s0225:
Aziz observed a ball in four situations:
1) the ball is resting in Aziz's hand;
2) Aziz threw the ball upward, and the ball is flying up;
3) the ball stopped for an instant at its highest point;
4) the ball fell to the ground and is lying still on the ground.
In which situations does the force of gravity act on the ball?

s0242:
An apple in an orchard was observed in three situations:
1) the apple is hanging on a branch;
2) the apple has come off the branch and is falling to the ground;
3) the picked apple is lying in a basket on a table.
In which situations does the force of gravity act on the apple?
